  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. This is the initial SDK release for AWS Control Catalog, a central catalog for AWS managed controls. This release includes 3 new APIs - ListDomains, ListObjectives, and ListCommonControls - that vend high-level data to categorize controls across the AWS platform.",
